  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The world I have created has the following class structure\n(a) A class that stores variables for each user and contains many [UdonSynced] variables\n(b) A class that controls synchronization variables between users using variables that are arrays of the class in (a) above\nIt was working properly around 2022/05/25 23:00 JST.\nIt stopped working properly around 2022/05/26 18:00 JST.\nVariables defined in class (a) above, may not be synchronized to other users.\nAs a trial, we moved some of the variables defined in class (a) to class (b), and only those variables are now synchronized.\nThis suggests that the system modification implemented near 2022/05/26JST has restricted the target of variables to be synchronized by [UdonSynced] to the class that references the variable.\nHowever, this modification does not seem to be explained in the official modifications.\n(Supplemental)\nThe world I produced uses U#.\nAlso, this text has been translated into English using DeepL translation. Sorry if it is difficult to read.",
